Please follow, rate, and review the show on Apple Podcasts or your podcast player of choice.
请在苹果播客或你选择的播客播放器上关注、评分和评论本节目。

00:49:14.920 --> 00:49:16.639
It really does help the show.
这真的对节目很有帮助。

00:49:16.639 --> 00:49:24.360
Our theme song is New York City by our own Josh Radner with additional music by Craig Thomas and Andrew Majuski.
我们的主题曲是《纽约市》，由我们自己的乔什·拉德纳创作，克雷格·托马斯和安德鲁·马朱斯基提供伴奏音乐。

00:49:24.360 --> 00:49:27.920
Special thanks to Lola Kennedy and Elliot Connors.
特别感谢罗拉·肯尼迪和埃利奥特·康纳斯。

00:49:27.920 --> 00:49:35.500
Visit HowWeMajorMother.com to learn more and click on the contact page to send us an email or a voice message.
访问 HowWeMajorMother.com 了解更多信息，并点击联系页面向我们发送电子邮件或语音留言。

00:49:35.500 --> 00:49:38.599
Your stories and questions are an important part of the show.
你的故事和问题是节目的重要组成部分。

00:49:38.599 --> 00:49:46.079
Subscribe to Josh Radner's newsletters on Substack and check out his music and everything else at JoshRadner.com.
欢迎在 Substack 上订阅乔什·拉德纳的时事通讯，并在 JoshRadner.com 上查看他的音乐及其他作品。

00:49:46.079 --> 00:49:56.019
Order Craig Thomas' debut novel, That's not how it happened, wherever books are sold, and check out his other published writings at CraigThomasWriter.com.
在各大图书销售渠道订购克雷格·托马斯的长篇小说处女作《事情可不是这样的》，并在 CraigThomasWriter.com 上查看他的其他已发表作品。

00:49:56.019 --> 00:50:01.340
And you can subscribe to my own dead father's society, also on Substack.
你也可以在 Substack 上订阅我自己的“死去的父亲协会”。

00:50:01.340 --> 00:50:13.579
To learn more about how you make a difference, this shows ongoing campaign to raise money for congenital pediatric heart disease research, check out the Make a Difference tab at the top of our website.
要了解有关本节目为先天性小儿心脏病研究筹款的长期活动如何发挥作用的更多信息，请查看我们网站顶部的“做出改变”标签页。

00:50:13.579 --> 00:50:16.500
People will, in fact, dance.
事实上，人们会跳舞的。

00:50:16.500 --> 00:50:28.099
Real question, it just hit me, or just New York City.
有个真正的问题，我刚想到的，还是说只是纽约市。
